# cursor-server — Product Index (PRD)

Living index of vision, features, roadmap, backlog, and done work.
**Progressive disclosure:** this file holds status + short scope; full detail lives in linked `*.spec.md` files in this folder.

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Updated | 2026-07-24 (task `agent` roles: default / planner / implementer / plan+implementer) |
| Priority order | Homelab-ready first (Compose → Tailscale/docs → auth → repo validation → **workflow-skills spec-to-pr*** → API depth → harness) |
| Spec folder | `.agents/specs/` |

