### Phase 1 — Homelab-ready (next priority)

Status: **partial** (Compose + Tailscale docs landed; auth, repo validation still open). Goal: run reliably on Umbrel/Compose over Tailscale with basic client auth and safe repo resolution.

- [x] Docker Compose stack
  - [x] Service definition (Node 20+, port, env)
  - [x] Persistent volume for `REPOS_ROOT` / `repos/`
  - [x] Document Umbrel / custom-app style usage
  - **spec:** `01-docker-compose.spec.md` (mirror) · canonical `.agents/plans/docker-compose/step-00-docker-compose.spec.md`
  - **plan:** `.agents/plans/docker-compose/step-01-docker-compose.plan.md`
  - **docs:** `docs/docker.md` · `Dockerfile` · `docker-compose.yml`
- [x] Tailscale-oriented defaults and docs
  - [x] Bind / HOST guidance for tailnet access
  - [x] Client reachability notes (no public exposure assumed)
  - **spec:** `02-tailscale-homelab-docs.spec.md` (mirror) · canonical `.agents/plans/tailscale-homelab-docs/step-00-tailscale-homelab-docs.spec.md`
  - **docs:** README Network access · `docs/docker.md` Network/Tailscale · `.env.example` HOST comment · AGENTS Deployment
- [x] Client authentication
  - [x] API key (or equivalent) for callers
  - [x] Reject unauthenticated task (and mutating) routes
  - **spec:** `03-client-auth.spec.md`
- [x] Repo registration and validation
  - [x] Ensure `{REPOS_ROOT}/{repo}` exists
  - [x] Ensure path is a git working tree (or documented allowlist)
  - [x] Clear 4xx errors for unknown / invalid repos
  - **spec:** `04-repo-validation.spec.md`

